---
// src/components/Business.astro
---
<section id="business">
    <div class="layout">
        <h2>Are you a local business?</h2>
        <p>
            Restaurant? Used book store? Cat cafe? No matter what you're
            selling, your customers need to know what you got and how to get it. <a
                href="/contact">Let me help.</a
            >
        </p>
        <ul class="features">
            <li>
                <article>
                    <h3>Strategy and Design</h3>
                    <p>
                        Before we build anything, we figure out what your
                        customers are looking for and how to get them there
                        fast. Then I design a site that looks like you, not a
                        template.
                    </p>
                </article>
            </li>
            <li>
                <article>
                    <h3>Hosting</h3>
                    <p>
                        Fast, secure, and backed up. I deal with the nerdy stuff so you don't have to worry.
                    </p>
                </article>
            </li>
            <li>
                <article>
                    <h3>Content Management</h3>
                    <p>
                        I can shepherd and format your content, or you can take
                        the reins with a CMS, including WordPress and headless
                        solutions like Contentful and Sanity.
                    </p>
                </article>
            </li>
            <li>
                <article>
                    <h3>Calendars and Menus</h3>
                    <p>
                        Specials change, hours shift, holidays happen. I’ll
                        build menus and calendars that are easy to update (or
                        I’ll update them for you) so your site never says
                        “closed” when you’re open.
                    </p>
                </article>
            </li>
            <li>
                <article>
                    <h3>Integrations</h3>
                    <p>
                        Keep your site in sync with outside services like
                        Eventbrite, Shopify, and CRMs.
                    </p>
                </article>
            </li>
            <li>
                <article>
                    <h3>Try a sample!</h3>
                    <p>
                        <a
                            href="https://spot-vallette.shannon-hubbell.workers.dev/">Spot Vallette</a
                        > is a New Orleans-style restaurant that doesn't actually
                        exist, but has a great website. <a
                            href="https://spot-vallette.shannon-hubbell.workers.dev/">Check it out!</a
                        >
                    </p>
                </article>
            </li>
        </ul>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    #business {
        background: #DDEBD3;
        color: #2B2D42;
        margin: 6rem 0 0 0;
        padding: 3rem 0 5rem;
        @media screen and (max-width: 500px) {
            padding: 2rem 0;
        }
        h2 {
            font-size: 3rem;
            font-weight: normal;
            color: #14151F;
        }
        a {
            color: #B22E47;
        }
        .features {
            list-style: none;
            margin: 3rem 0 0 0;
            padding: 0;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 1.5rem;
            @media screen and (max-width: 750px) {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            }
            @media screen and (max-width: 500px) {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(1, 1fr);
            }
            li {
                background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
                padding: 1.5em;
                border-radius: 8px;
            }
            h3 {
                font-size: 2rem;
                font-weight: normal;
                color: #14151F;
                text-wrap: pretty;
                padding: 0;
                margin: 0;
            }
            p {
                font-size: 1.25rem;
                line-height: 180%;
                margin: 1rem 0;
                text-wrap: pretty;
            }
        }
    }
</style>
